 Foster a =E2=80=9Cspirit of competition=E2=80=9D to inspire and motivate w=
ater users
toward excellence in water management.

Award Categories:

 Water Management - Within Plant Premises=20

 Water for Community - CSR Initiatives by Industry

 Innovative Water Technology/Product

 Excellence in Rainwater Harvesting

 Excellence in Urban Water Management

